      "content": "That's a pretty compelling case for UBI. It seems like the logic holds up when you look at the scale of the problem. If we're trying to avoid widespread civil unrest caused by permanent unemployment, wouldn't it be more responsible for a government to focus on UBI rather than trying to patch up a broken, outdated welfare system that just isn't built for this kind of economic shift?",
